MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Gab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Gab_m01_001: You brought yet another outsider in?! Just what kind\nof a place do you think this is?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Gab_m01_002: Eh, but you've got the Lady of Lilies favoring you...\nI'll turn a blind eye. This time.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Gab_m01: <BLN>What do you think this is?!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_Arena_m01_001: The next match is on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default} in the morning.\nMake sure you don't forget!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Hur_Arena_m01: <BLN>The next match is...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_001: You're participating in the Heroic Games?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_002: You're trying to save Castor, and you've already won\na qualifier, but...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_003: I'm not sure how to take this. Cai, I'm happy you're\nso enthused, but this is truly concerning.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_004: The Heroic Games are a collection of the most skilled\nfighters from across the continent.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_008: <NCA>Act confident.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_009: <NCB>Admit to a little fear.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_005: <ACA>I suppose Castor did say he'd worked to hammer all\nof his skills into you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_006: You're as stubborn as your father. It's so dangerous,\nand I wish that I could stop you...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01_007: Just try not to get injured, alright? And don't put\nyour friends in too much danger either.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Aur_m01: <BLN>The Heroic Games?!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01_001: My granddad left us so far in debt. My mom had to\ntravel to find work to pay it off.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01_002: Thanks to that hard work, it looks like we'll be able\nto live together as a family again!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01_003: Oh. I'm sorry, Cai. I didn't think about... I'm so sorry\nCastor's in the situation he's in.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01_004: If you can get the attention of the Divine Sovereign\nby competing in the Heroic Games...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01_005: you might get your wish granted even if you\ndon't win the contest. Hang in there!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Hur_m01: <BLN>My family...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Tia_m01_001: Aswan... Aswan... I know that name. I'm pretty sure\nit was a princess from Arago...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Tia_m01_002: Argh! The more I think about the two of them, the\nmore curious I get!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Tia_m01_003: The White-Maned Demon—er, Bertrand—has a\nmore complex history than I first thought.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Tia_m01: <BLN>Aswan...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_001: Seems like you and Theodora have gotten\na little friendlier.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_002: <NCA>Say you have an understanding.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_003: <NCB>Deny it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_004: <ACA>You really are something, Cai...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_005: <ACB>Really? But in the last match, you two seemed to\nget along really well.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_006: I couldn't deal with someone so scary. Everything I'd\ntry to say would get stuck in my throat.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01_007: Heck, I'm shook up just thinking about the name of\nthe next clan we're fighting.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Pet_m01: <BLN>So, Theodora...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cen_m01_001: Benditz is leader of the Thundercloud Knights clan...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cen_m01_002: I feel I've seen him somewhere before, but I can't\nremember where.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cen_m01_003: Hm, there was a centurion by that name dismissed\nfrom service years ago. It can't be... Can it?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Cen_m01: <BLN>I don't remember...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cas_m01_001: You're here again? You shouldn't spend all your time\nhanging around he—ah—ACHOO!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Cas_m01_002: Been sneezing all morning. There's an old saying that\nsneezing a lot means someone's badmouthing you.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Cas_m01: <BLN>Here again?!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Bel_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Bel_m01_001: So long has passed since I saw Aswan. What a relief\nto see that she's alright.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Bel_m01_002: Thank you for bringing her to my cell.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Bel_m01_003: What? She saw you in the match and could tell that\nI'd been mentoring you?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_Bel_m01_004: Well, she did use to enjoy watching me train.\nI suppose that's how she knew.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_Bel_m01: <BLN>I must thank you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_B01_m01_001: Whoa! You brought another friend, huh? And this\none's a sweet-looking lady?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_B01_m01: <BLN>Another one?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c05_B02_m01_002: Wow, who's that girl? She's so pretty. She looks\njust like a princess!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c05_B02_m01: <BLN>Wow!